message: >-
  Please cite this software and, when available, the version-specific
  Zenodo record linked from its GitHub release.
type: software
title: "Callosal disconnection EEG analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ukishiro"
    given-names: "Kazushi"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kazushiukishiro/callosal-disconnection-eeg"
url: "https://github.com/kazushiukishiro/callosal-disconnection-eeg"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB source functions and refactored analysis components for intraoperative
  EEG connectivity analysis during sequential corpus callosal disconnection,
  with synthetic component demonstrations and bounded validation records.
  Supplementary sources include the matched Figure 4 plotting function and
  a supplied residual-splenium analysis function. Patient-level data and a
  complete end-to-end clinical reproduction workflow are not distributed.
keywords:
  - EEG
  - corpus callosotomy
  - wavelet coherence
  - MATLAB
  - functional connectivity
  - synthetic demonstrations
